  "description": "For little Mint, every day is hell at the Merigold orphanage. One day, Master Yulius, the Grand Duke of Elkedonia, offers to take her in as the little lady of Elkedonia! However, Mint is extremely shy and nervous, and such a huge transformation doesn’t happen overnight. Join Mint as she grows from a meek girl to a daring, outspoken lady while magical and religious tensions unfold! \n\n(Source: Webtoons)",
